How about:

wz <- which(diff(x == 0) != 0)
x[(wz[1] + 1):wz[length(wz)]]

This assumes you always have zeros present. It would have to be 
re-worked in the cases were you do no have zeros either at the 
beginning, the end of the vector, or both.

